    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Bonds is a puzzle platformer where you switch between the perspectives of two characters to solve puzzles in a spaceship. Can you and your unlikely duo escape the spaceship, or will you be stuck puzzling forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/8e422a4d878d55bfaaf284aa5a43b507.avif?t=1752830477\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/639a2e708fe7abbeea10a20975985041.poster.avif?t=1752830477\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/639a2e708fe7abbeea10a20975985041.webm?t=1752830477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/639a2e708fe7abbeea10a20975985041.mp4?t=1752830477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small single-player game (game length depends on how smart you are)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles by switching between the perspectives of two characters  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an astronaut and his robot each stuck in a different part of a deserted spaceship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip levers, push buttons, use portals and much more to reach the exit doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an exciting story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/62741dc866c7cb0de4b34238be381841.avif?t=1752830477\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><table><tr><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/f603d9bf8d46d9f7276b50dafa092134.poster.avif?t=1752830477\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/f603d9bf8d46d9f7276b50dafa092134.webm?t=1752830477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/f603d9bf8d46d9f7276b50dafa092134.mp4?t=1752830477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/97abacc37de7881b33c82c44896a4335.poster.avif?t=1752830477\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/97abacc37de7881b33c82c44896a4335.webm?t=1752830477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/97abacc37de7881b33c82c44896a4335.mp4?t=1752830477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></td></tr></table><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by Castical. Follow the development on YouTube! </p>",
